                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d26e00ac-b0b2-3a9d-83f2-1413e3d01866",
                        "entry_id": "13955511-bdb6-3716-9536-c522bd867bd3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone or something that fluffs (in various senses)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87818b4a-db24-4bda-9497-f07ddc4670f9",
                                "sense_id": "d26e00ac-b0b2-3a9d-83f2-1413e3d01866",
                                "text": "Woe betide the camera-shy or the fluffers of lines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24017fff-09d8-4ce4-ab84-79533b7e092e",
                                "sense_id": "d26e00ac-b0b2-3a9d-83f2-1413e3d01866",
                                "text": "To them, we were the dope-smuggling hippie liberals, the prisoner lovers, the pillow fluffers. To us, they were the sadistic, mean-spirited, right-wing thugs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "736aab42-8228-3be1-9f36-50d015684153",
                        "entry_id": "13955511-bdb6-3716-9536-c522bd867bd3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who arouses male pornographic actors before filming."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15a9d5e2-0595-4a47-a34f-b5c8efb0dd7f",
                                "sense_id": "736aab42-8228-3be1-9f36-50d015684153",
                                "text": "\"This isn't MGM. I don't do this full-time,\" she said. \"During production, I'm the AD. Occasionally, I fill in as a fluffer.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3fe51dd-94a4-31fe-be72-b5a124d8dcee",
                        "entry_id": "13955511-bdb6-3716-9536-c522bd867bd3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who is employed to clean the tracks in the tunnels of the London Underground."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1fd1ef83-8aa5-3062-a023-174f9f16d1b6",
                        "entry_id": "13955511-bdb6-3716-9536-c522bd867bd3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who promotes or publicizes, especially one who makes something seem better or more important than it is."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a310e3d6-5fde-4d1b-aee4-330cc4da38f8",
                                "sense_id": "1fd1ef83-8aa5-3062-a023-174f9f16d1b6",
                                "text": "Thus it was only as I approached the table that I discovered Lafayette hovering behind the chair next to mine, accompanied by Easy Mather, as well as their new best friend and Lafayette's personal fluffer, Jillian Noble."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9b45b80-012a-4968-a7e2-3ed44ddfa522",
                                "sense_id": "1fd1ef83-8aa5-3062-a023-174f9f16d1b6",
                                "text": "There is always a “fluffer” who will posture for “good girl, good boy” attention, who will bring up some off-topic item—“good food drive effort” or “great basketball game the other night.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c659412-d5a3-4929-b457-d1443bbca8c4",
                                "sense_id": "1fd1ef83-8aa5-3062-a023-174f9f16d1b6",
                                "text": ". In many retellings of the story, Aphrodite acts as Helen's fluffer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a82f7f75-058e-3a0d-b29a-b898ae8a6364",
                        "entry_id": "13955511-bdb6-3716-9536-c522bd867bd3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fluffy animal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30df140e-6f00-42cf-8a43-47bda9daa6a0",
                                "sense_id": "a82f7f75-058e-3a0d-b29a-b898ae8a6364",
                                "text": "DoggoLingo, sometimes referred to as doggo-speak, \"seems to be quite lexical, there are a lot of distinctive words that are used,\" says Internet linguist Gretchen McCulloch. \"It's cutesier than others, too. Doggo, woofer, pupper, pupperino, fluffer — those have all got an extra suffix on the end to make them cuter.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
